{"id":"78bf2ec267a1c34b","group":"91","path":"91/91-df-self-reference.md","title":"相对理论的对角自指关系","display":"df-self-reference — 相对理论的对角自指关系","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-df-self-reference","aliases":["91-df-self-reference","91-df-self-referential"],"display":"df-self-reference — 相对理论的对角自指关系","depends_on":["[[91-thm-diagonal-lemma]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-df-self-reference"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-df-self-reference</span><span>91-df-self-referential</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-self-reference — 相对理论的对角自指关系"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"41fdad0bfaff0bf5\" href=\"?note=41fdad0bfaff0bf5\" title=\"91-thm-diagonal-lemma\">91-thm-diagonal-lemma</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\supseteq\\mathrm{PA}\">\\(S\\supseteq\\mathrm{PA}\\)</span> 为经典有效算术扩张，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi(x)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}^{1}_{\\mathcal L_S}\">\\(\\varphi(x)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}^{1}_{\\mathcal L_S}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_S}\">\\(\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_S}\\)</span>；句法编码及数码固定。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SelfRef}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{SelfRef}_S\\)</span> 是下述元层二元关系。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}self\\text{-}reference}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{SelfRef}_S(\\psi,\\varphi)\\coloneqq\n\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_S}\\land\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}^{1}_{\\mathcal L_S}\\land\n[S\\vdash\\psi\\leftrightarrow\\varphi(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\psi\\urcorner})].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}self\\text{-}reference}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{SelfRef}_S(\\psi,\\varphi)\\coloneqq\n\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_S}\\land\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}^{1}_{\\mathcal L_S}\\land\n[S\\vdash\\psi\\leftrightarrow\\varphi(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\psi\\urcorner})].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对角引理给每个固定矩阵一个相应句子；它不是任意弱语言都必有的现象。\n一般经典可证对角双条件不能直接在强 Kleene 语义中当作任意等值替换；分析说谎者或真理陈述者需要已落实的直接闭项语法实现。直接真理陈述者在不同一致固定点可以真、假或有间隙，旧“两解”描述遗漏第三种值。\n原书有类型 TB/UTB/CT 的语言仍允许写自应用句，只是没有给这些句配置自己的全部去引号公理；原“类型化禁止自指”表述过强。</p>\n<p>来源：§5.1、§5.3 的编码背景；第 13 章和 §15.1 的直接自指语法；Definition 10.1。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-thm-diagonal-lemma","status":"resolved","id":"41fdad0bfaff0bf5","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-thm-diagonal-lemma]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"S\\supseteq\\mathrm{PA}","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi(x)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}^{1}_{\\mathcal L_S}","display":false},{"tex":"\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_S}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SelfRef}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}self\\text{-}reference}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{SelfRef}_S(\\psi,\\varphi)\\coloneqq\n\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_S}\\land\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}^{1}_{\\mathcal L_S}\\land\n[S\\vdash\\psi\\leftrightarrow\\varphi(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\psi\\urcorner})].","display":true}],"bytes":1566,"backlinks":[{"id":"967c10482b90bea3","anchor":"ref-47","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-self-reference]]"},{"id":"4278731e7fc892de","anchor":"ref-61","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-self-reference]]"},{